WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:02.331
- We're here today to get face tattoos.

00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:04.331
(music)

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:09.686
- Not like face face
tattoos, but like portraits

00:00:09.686 --> 00:00:12.174
of each other's faces on the other's body.

00:00:12.174 --> 00:00:13.772
We've been together, what like --

00:00:13.772 --> 00:00:14.626
- About five years.

00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:16.002
Married for four and a half of them.

00:00:16.002 --> 00:00:17.946
- Why not just commit
to a lifetime of like

00:00:17.946 --> 00:00:19.757
our youngest and best selves

00:00:19.757 --> 00:00:22.154
on each other's bodies forever?

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:24.337
- It's unusual, certainly,
but I think it's kind of

00:00:24.337 --> 00:00:27.890
a cool extension of our existing
commitment to each other

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.376
and if for whatever reason that changed

00:00:29.376 --> 00:00:31.741
down the road, lasers exist.

00:00:31.741 --> 00:00:32.574
- Hey!

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:35.026
♫ You had me at hello

00:00:35.026 --> 00:00:38.631
♫ Girl, I almost fainted

00:00:38.631 --> 00:00:42.798
♫ Too much for my young heart and soul

00:00:44.331 --> 00:00:46.490
- Hey, I'm Zoey and
we're here at The Warren.

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:48.335
This is my shop and I have been tattooing

00:00:48.335 --> 00:00:49.988
for about 17 years now.

00:00:49.988 --> 00:00:52.105
I'm a pretty versatile artist.

00:00:52.105 --> 00:00:54.684
My strength would be portraits or realism.

00:00:54.684 --> 00:00:56.737
There is just something about faces that

00:00:56.737 --> 00:00:58.315
when you can capture somebody's face

00:00:58.315 --> 00:01:00.416
and their expression that
is kind of a special thing.

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:02.712
So, it's just something I
have always been drawn to.

00:01:02.712 --> 00:01:04.618
People worry about, "Oh,
what if they break up?"

00:01:04.618 --> 00:01:07.308
But I think tattoos
are very much bookmarks

00:01:07.308 --> 00:01:09.547
of moments in your life
and regardless of what

00:01:09.547 --> 00:01:11.760
happens to them, this is
a big part of their life.

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.579
So, I think it's cool.

00:01:13.579 --> 00:01:16.246
(uptempo music)

00:01:17.669 --> 00:01:18.974
Where are you guys thinking
about putting these?

00:01:18.974 --> 00:01:21.290
- I was kind of leaning more
towards my shoulder area.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.543
Somewhere in this real estate here.

00:01:22.543 --> 00:01:23.426
- On your chest?

00:01:23.426 --> 00:01:24.380
- Yeah, kind of...
- Cool.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:25.996
- I'm a little on the fence but I'm open

00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:28.244
to like, placing it in different areas.

00:01:28.244 --> 00:01:29.910
- And we can stencil
you in a couple places

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:30.920
and see what feels right.

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:31.753
- [Kelly] If that's okay.

00:01:31.753 --> 00:01:32.926
- [Zoey] Yeah.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:33.918
- Taylor, you want to go first?

00:01:33.918 --> 00:01:34.751
- Yeah! Let's do it!

00:01:34.751 --> 00:01:35.584
- Can you get naked?

00:01:35.584 --> 00:01:37.061
- Yeah!

00:01:37.061 --> 00:01:39.061
(music)

00:01:40.323 --> 00:01:45.222
- [Kelly] I don't know, do
you feel weird about that?

00:01:45.222 --> 00:01:46.055
- That's true.

00:01:46.055 --> 00:01:48.363
I almost feel like I'm an evil twin growth

00:01:48.363 --> 00:01:50.014
or something that's growing out of you.

00:01:50.014 --> 00:01:51.435
- [Zoey] You guys want to move it?

00:01:51.435 --> 00:01:52.755
- Yeah, let's move it.

00:01:52.755 --> 00:01:55.422
(uptempo music)

00:01:57.421 --> 00:01:58.705
- I like that so much better.

00:01:58.705 --> 00:02:00.121
- Awesome, I love it.

00:02:00.121 --> 00:02:01.239
- It's perfect.

00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:02.802
♫ Let's make it last forever

00:02:02.802 --> 00:02:05.176
♫ 'Cause the night's still young

00:02:05.176 --> 00:02:06.930
♫ It's true I feel the pressure

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.485
♫ Every time you're gone

00:02:09.485 --> 00:02:13.152
♫ As long as we're together

00:02:14.013 --> 00:02:18.308
♫ This moment lasts forever

00:02:18.308 --> 00:02:21.141
("Wait" by NoMBe)

00:02:23.987 --> 00:02:24.904
- So weird.

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.037
It's eerie because it
looks like me so much

00:02:28.037 --> 00:02:30.198
but it's also just sort of weird

00:02:30.198 --> 00:02:32.531
to see my face on your body.

00:02:33.449 --> 00:02:37.616
And know that it's never
going anywhere. (laughs)

00:02:38.453 --> 00:02:41.286
("Wait" by NoMBe)

00:02:48.424 --> 00:02:49.841
- I think the sound of the machine

00:02:49.841 --> 00:02:52.292
is actually very soothing
so it just becomes

00:02:52.292 --> 00:02:55.601
like a meditative state, eventually.

00:02:55.601 --> 00:02:58.268
(uptempo music)

00:03:11.634 --> 00:03:12.975
- We're all done!

00:03:12.975 --> 00:03:14.627
Time for you guys to get to take a look.

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:15.627
- Oh my God.

00:03:17.259 --> 00:03:18.824
I'm not ready yet, you go first. (laughs)

00:03:18.824 --> 00:03:20.157
- Okay. Alright!

00:03:21.082 --> 00:03:22.397
Moment of truth.

00:03:22.397 --> 00:03:23.929
- It's happening!

00:03:23.929 --> 00:03:24.762
- Whoa!

00:03:26.888 --> 00:03:27.721
- Oh my God!

00:03:27.721 --> 00:03:28.554
- That's awesome!

00:03:28.554 --> 00:03:30.254
- It's like frightening how much prettier

00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:31.660
I am as a tattoo.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.528
- [Taylor] Oh hush. You
do look great, though.

00:03:33.528 --> 00:03:36.125
- I mean, yeah. Holy crap that like...

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:37.385
- This is so awesome!

00:03:37.385 --> 00:03:39.187
- That looks just like my face.

00:03:39.187 --> 00:03:40.020
- Shocker.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.505
- (laughs) I know, can you believe it?

00:03:41.505 --> 00:03:43.506
- It works. Are you ready?

00:03:43.506 --> 00:03:44.531
- Are you excited?

00:03:44.531 --> 00:03:45.614
- Yeah, I am.

00:03:46.923 --> 00:03:47.919
- Oh my God!

00:03:47.919 --> 00:03:49.021
- [Taylor] What?

00:03:49.021 --> 00:03:49.875
- It's you!

00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:51.069
- [Taylor] That is me.

00:03:51.069 --> 00:03:52.203
- Look how excited you are

00:03:52.203 --> 00:03:53.823
to live on my arm forever.

00:03:53.823 --> 00:03:55.512
- During it, I was like, oh God,

00:03:55.512 --> 00:03:56.615
what if I hate this?

00:03:56.615 --> 00:03:58.652
But it actually makes me excited

00:03:58.652 --> 00:04:01.485
to see you excited on my arm.

00:04:01.485 --> 00:04:03.366
You look so happy to be here!

00:04:03.366 --> 00:04:04.199
- That's me!

00:04:04.199 --> 00:04:05.276
- (Kelly laughs)

00:04:05.276 --> 00:04:06.842
- [Taylor] Thanks Zoey!
That's amazing work!

00:04:06.842 --> 00:04:07.956
- [Kelly] I mean, it's like you've

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:09.511
made us even better looking.

00:04:09.511 --> 00:04:11.073
- You guys take good pictures, so.

00:04:11.073 --> 00:04:13.199
- I also feel like I'm going to be

00:04:13.199 --> 00:04:15.573
less inclined to get mad at you sometimes

00:04:15.573 --> 00:04:17.890
just because you look so happy here.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.138
- [Taylor] Tattoo's already paying off.

00:04:19.138 --> 00:04:20.343
(Kelly laughs)

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:22.041
- Do you think other
people should do this?

00:04:22.041 --> 00:04:24.032
- Yes! Absolutely.

00:04:24.032 --> 00:04:27.115
I mean look how well this turned out.

00:04:32.145 --> 00:04:34.371
Hey do you want to make out?

00:04:34.371 --> 00:04:35.204
- I mean, like?

00:04:35.204 --> 00:04:36.037
- Yeah!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.732
- Nope, that stings too much

00:04:38.732 --> 00:04:41.446
I'm not ready for that
sort of weirdness just yet.

00:04:41.446 --> 00:04:42.807
- Coming up soon.

00:04:42.807 --> 00:04:46.330
♫ You had me at hello

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:50.514
♫ Girl, I almost fainted

00:04:50.514 --> 00:04:54.654
♫ Too much for my young heart and soul

00:04:54.654 --> 00:04:57.487
♫ To bear to feel

